Z||000003||JohnF||11-05-2001||09:21 AM||||Have a wrecker take it someplace whare it can be left safely for a day (home?).  Wrecker drivers have no need for keys and cost is less than replacing whatever you are going to tear up!  Your insurance may even cover it.<P>Take the VIN and a copy of your ownership papers (license plate renewal, insurance papers, title, etc) to any GM dealer.  Parts man can and will cut you a complete set of keys for less than $5.||||reg||12
